<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian Treasury offers A$300 mln of notes.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian Treasury offers A$300 mln of notes.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Treasury will offer a total of A$300 million of Treasury notes for tender on Wednesday, the Reserve Bank of Australia said.  </p>
<p>The tender offer is all in the 13-week note maturity.</p>
<p>The Treasury last week offered a total of A$300 million in 26-week notes only.</p>
<p>There are A$172 million of non-official holdings of T-notes maturing in the week ending November 28.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
